   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An Agent is a scoped AI operator\ncreated by a user for ONE DevOps job.\n\nIt understands natural-language requests,\nuses only its configured tools,\nworks only on its configured infrastructure,\nand performs only its allowed operations.",
