   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🤖 Findings\n• Deployment payment-service: 2/3 pods Ready\n• Pods restarting: CrashLoopBackOff (14 restarts / 30 min)\n• Events: OOMKilled — memory limit 256Mi exceeded\n• Logs: memory spike after latest release\n\nLikely cause:\n  Pods run out of memory since the latest release.\n\nRecommended action:\n  1. Raise memory limit → needs team change\n     (outside this agent's capabilities)\n  2. Interim: scale 3 → 5 replicas\n     (allowed — requires approval)",
   "originalText": "🤖 Findings\n• Deployment payment-service: 2/3 pods Ready\n• Pods restarting: CrashLoopBackOff (14 restarts / 30 min)\n• Events: OOMKilled — memory limit 256Mi exceeded\n• Logs: memory spike after latest release\n\nLikely cause:\n  Pods run out of memory since the latest release.\n\nRecommended action:\n  1. Raise memory limit → needs team change\n     (outside this agent's capabilities)\n  2. Interim: scale 3 → 5 replicas\n     (allowed — requires approval)",
